### Key Results

The replication successfully demonstrated:
- Loading the Leela Chess Zero model (T82-768x15x24h, 15 layers, 768 dimensions)
- Applying the logit lens to extract intermediate policy distributions
- Tracking policy evolution: correct move probability increased from 1.4% (input) to 78.5% (final layer)
- Only the final two layers (Layer 13 and Full Model) correctly predict the solution
- Numerical validation: policies sum to 1.0 and are non-negative

